   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The challenge lane re-uses the pair from step 1 and lowers a relation to INCONCLUSIVE, never to a contradiction.\nThe graph summary and impact plan the challenge now returns are computed beside this lane and never feed it.\nNothing is persisted, so nothing can drift out of sync with the source text.",
   "originalText": "The challenge lane re-uses the pair from step 1 and lowers a relation to INCONCLUSIVE, never to a contradiction.\nThe graph summary and impact plan the challenge now returns are computed beside this lane and never feed it.\nNothing is persisted, so nothing can drift out of sync with the source text.",
